# Pilot branding patch — applied on top of Chromium source

From: Starillus Developers <starillus@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Pilot: rebrand Chromium as Pilot for Starillus OS

--- a/chrome/app/resources/generated_resources.grd
+++ b/chrome/app/resources/generated_resources.grd
@@ IDS_SHORT_PRODUCT_NAME
- "Chromium"
+ "Pilot"

@@ IDS_PRODUCT_NAME
- "Chromium"
+ "Pilot Browser"

--- a/chrome/app/resources/id_map_generated.h
@@ IDS_SHORT_PRODUCT_NAME 101
@@ IDS_PRODUCT_NAME 102

--- a/chrome/common/chrome_constants.cc
@@ const char kUserAgentSuffix[] = " Chromium/"
+ const char kUserAgentSuffix[] = " Pilot/"

--- a/chrome/app/google_chrome_100.png
[binary replaced with starillus pilot logo]
